    title: "Office Colour Trends in Australia: Moving Beyond Grey and White",
    metaDescription: "The office colour trends reshaping Australian commercial interiors in 2025. From the end of greige to earthy tones, deep hues, and the science of colour in the workplace.",
    primaryKeyword: "office colour trends Australia",
