    secondaryKeywords: ["business case office furniture", "office fitout return on investment", "office furniture productivity"],
    readTime: "6 min read",
    publishDate: "2026-01-10",
    excerpt: "The business case for quality office furniture investment is rarely made systematically — it tends to be made emotionally ('we want a nice office') or not at all. The evidence for systematic ROI from quality workplace investment is substantial and worth understanding.",
    tags: ["ROI", "investment", "productivity", "business case"],
